{"ID":"20240206093712-ovv21g3","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206093712-ovv21g3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093712-ovv21g3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093721-i4urfyl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093717-iv33o38\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093721-i4urfyl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:154,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:154\u0026#125;","title":"朱砂根","type":"doc","updated":"20240902084348"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206093721-i4urfyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093721-i4urfyl","updated":"20240206093725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产两广地区和江西、浙江等地。\n【性状】\t根簇生于略膨大的根茎上，呈圆柱形，略弯曲，长525cm，直径210mm。表面棕褐色或灰棕色，具多数纵皱纹及横向或环状断裂痕，皮部与木部易分离。质硬而脆，易折断，折断面不平坦，皮部厚，约占断面的一半，类白色或浅紫红色，木部淡黄色。气微，味微苦、辛，有刺舌感。\n【性味】\t苦、辛，平。\n【功效】\t行血祛风，解毒消肿。用于上呼吸道感染，咽喉肿痛，扁桃体炎，白喉，支气管炎，风湿性关节炎，腰腿痛，跌打损伤，丹毒，淋巴结炎；外用治外伤肿痛，骨折，毒蛇咬伤。\n【注解】\t“朱砂点”：药材平整切面上可见的散在朱砂色麻点，即油室。"}]},{"ID":"20240206093717-iv33o38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093717-iv33o38","updated":"20240206093717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206093717-tpgbwb6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715084358-htgi996","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715084358-htgi996","updated":"20240715085328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 358px;","style":"width: 348px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240715084358-4a5o4p0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 348px;\" parent-style=\"width: 358px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902084348-92ezxha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084348-92ezxha","updated":"20240902084348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 522px;","style":"width: 512px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"朱砂根 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/朱砂根 5-20240715084851-dxax3p8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 512px;\" parent-style=\"width: 522px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 695px;","style":"width: 685px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"朱砂根 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/朱砂根 7-20240715085138-r4kju3q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 685px;\" parent-style=\"width: 695px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902084348-5263mok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084348-5263mok","updated":"20240902084348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 571px;","style":"width: 561px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"朱砂根 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/朱砂根 9-20240715085244-s6m2k56.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 561px;\" parent-style=\"width: 571px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 675px;","style":"width: 665px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"朱砂根 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/朱砂根 8-20240715085252-ia19hqp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 665px;\" parent-style=\"width: 675px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715083943-ppmiz0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715083943-ppmiz0r","updated":"20240715084522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"朱砂根 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/朱砂根 1-20240715083943-m6qjq3w.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 595px;","style":"width: 585px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"朱砂根 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/朱砂根 2-20240715084302-7w7frii.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 585px;\" parent-style=\"width: 595px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715084634-vm8f82w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715084634-vm8f82w","updated":"20240715084723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 791px;","style":"width: 781px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"朱砂根 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/朱砂根 3-20240715084634-n23xz33.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 781px;\" parent-style=\"width: 791px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 401px;","style":"width: 391px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"朱砂根 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/朱砂根 4-20240715084723-u4j9rph.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 391px;\" parent-style=\"width: 401px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715085434-yfjv5qh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715085434-yfjv5qh","updated":"20240715085438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 766px;","style":"width: 756px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"朱砂根 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/朱砂根 11-20240715085438-7t9j78s.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 756px;\" parent-style=\"width: 766px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"朱砂根 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/朱砂根 10-20240715085434-r9f16n6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715083859-iggj8u2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715083859-iggj8u2","updated":"20240715085049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 614px;","style":"width: 604px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"朱砂根"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/朱砂根-20240715083859-lf5wh54.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 604px;\" parent-style=\"width: 614px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 612px;","style":"width: 602px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"朱砂根 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/朱砂根 6-20240715085049-ysxjc90.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 602px;\" parent-style=\"width: 612px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715084933-90yl00n","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240715084933-90yl00n"}},{"ID":"20240830172546-j895pcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-j895pcv","updated":"20240830172553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：朱砂根"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-nwjofu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-nwjofu2","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"朱砂根《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-ikycjoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-ikycjoq","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ZhūShāGēn"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-z47o5aq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-z47o5aq","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】大罗伞、大凉伞、珍珠伞、凉伞遮珍珠、高脚金鸡、凤凰肠、豹子眼睛果、铁凉伞、开喉箭、山豆根[湖南、福建、云南]"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-191614l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-191614l","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为紫金牛科紫金牛属植物圆齿紫金牛ArdisiacrenataSims和紫背紫金牛A.bicolorWalk.的根。秋季采挖，切碎，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-r67fhnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-r67fhnk","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦、辛，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-waic1b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-waic1b1","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】行血祛风，解毒消肿。用于上呼吸道感染，咽喉肿痛，扁桃体炎，白喉，支气管炎，风湿性关节炎，腰腿痛，跌打损伤，丹毒，淋巴结炎；外用治外伤肿痛，骨折，毒蛇咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-ale5ude","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-ale5ude","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】1～3钱；外用适量，鲜根或鲜叶捣烂敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-kkxdz61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-kkxdz61","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】据报道，本品如服至0.5～1两时，可出现恶心，厌食等副作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-jiqhlrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-jiqhlrz","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-rrfcz30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-rrfcz30","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"朱砂根《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-fajf3w8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-fajf3w8","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-nbako8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-nbako8g","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ZhūShāGēn"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-df7wpqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-df7wpqa","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】凤凰肠、老鼠尾（《生草药性备要》），平地木、石青子、凉伞遮金珠、山豆根、地杨梅（《植物名实图考》），散血丹、浪伞根、金鸡爪（《岭南采药录》），高脚罗伞（《陆川本草》），小罗伞（《南宁市药物志》），土丹皮（《广西中药志》），金锁匙、开喉箭、三条根、三两金、高茶风、铁凉伞、雪里开花（《湖南药物志》），金鸡凉伞（《杭州药植志》），大罗伞、大凉伞、凤凰翔（广州部队《常用中草药手册》），红铜盘、高脚铜盘、青红草、硬脚金鸡、珍珠伞、桂笃油（《浙江民间常用草药》），真珠凉伞（《福建中草药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-9tn440z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-9tn440z","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为紫金牛科植物朱砂根的根。秋后采挖根部，洗净晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-8b5dj7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-8b5dj7c","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-woh4vxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-woh4vxh","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"灌木，高达1.5米，全体秃净。茎直立，有数个分枝。叶纸质至革质，椭圆状披针形至倒披针形，长6～12厘米，宽2～4厘米；先端短尖或渐尖，基部短尖或楔尖，两面均秃净，有隆起的腺点，边缘有钝圆波状齿，背卷，有腺体；侧脉12～18对，极纤细，近边缘处结合而成一边脉，常隐于卷边内；叶柄长5～10毫米。伞形花序顶生或腋生，花序柄长1.5～2厘米；花白色或淡红色；萼片5裂，裂片长卵形，钝头；花冠5裂，裂片长椭圆状披针形，长4～5毫米，与萼片均有稀疏的腺点；雄蕊5，花丝极短，基部扁；子房上位，花柱线形。核果球形，直径约6毫米，熟时红色，有黑色斑点。花期6～7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-z07eaez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-z07eaez","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本植物的叶（朱砂根叶）亦供药用，另详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-qkvm865","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-qkvm865","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于山地林下、沟边、路旁。分布浙江、安徽、江西、湖南、湖北、四川、福建、广东、广西等地。产福建、湖南、广西。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-jpndosn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-jpndosn","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥根，多分枝，呈细圆柱状，略弯曲，长短不一，径4～10毫米。表面暗紫色或暗棕色，有纵向皱纹及须根痕。质坚硬，断面木部与皮部易分离，皮部发达，约占断面1／2，淡紫色，木部淡黄色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-rbtp660","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-rbtp660","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】25％煎剂试管内对金黄色葡萄球菌、大肠杆菌、绿脓杆菌有轻度的抑制作用。60％的乙醇提取物有抗早孕作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-f7wbign","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-f7wbign","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-y8a2umm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-y8a2umm","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦辛，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-eh9ij7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-eh9ij7q","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"苦，凉，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-ytc1xyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-ytc1xyo","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《生草药性备要》：\"味甘，性平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-5wbxntx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-5wbxntx","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《陆川本草》：\"辛苦，性寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-jpg1mb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-jpg1mb6","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-ljrglur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-ljrglur","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清热解毒，散瘀止痛。治上感，扁桃体炎，急性咽峡炎，白喉，丹毒，淋巴结炎，劳伤吐血，心胃气痛，风湿骨痛，跌打损伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-p9pexx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-p9pexx5","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"治咽喉肿痹，磨水或醋咽之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-hcnupym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-hcnupym","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《生草药性备要））：\"治痰火，跌打，去瘀生新，宽筋续骨。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-tkfqc4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-tkfqc4t","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《岭南采药录》：\"治小儿干（疳）痞。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-o1j7rnp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-o1j7rnp","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《广西中药志》：\"治风湿骨痛，鹤膝风。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-nwo0f42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-nwo0f42","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《湖南药物志》：\"治劳伤吐血，血崩，心胃气痛，腹胀腹痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-vw94bii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-vw94bii","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《浙江民间常用草药》：\"清热解毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-xo1l70x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-xo1l70x","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3～5钱；或研末为丸、浸酒。外用：捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-sqmhudg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-sqmhudg","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-574pllm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-574pllm","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治咽喉肿痛：㈠朱砂根三至五钱。水煎服。㈡朱砂根全草二钱，射干一钱，甘草一钱。水煎服。（《湖南药物志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-ivoqkp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-ivoqkp9","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治风湿骨节痛：小郎伞五钱，木通二两，虎骨三钱，鸡骨香三钱，大血藤四钱，桑寄生三钱。浸酒二斤，每服五钱至一两，日二次。（《广西中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-5308n2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-5308n2w","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治上呼吸道感染，扁桃体炎，白喉，丹毒，淋巴结炎，能抗菌消炎退热：朱砂根三至五钱，煎服；或研末蜜丸，每次二至三钱，一天二次。（浙江《中草药抗菌消炎经验交流会资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-jen36p8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-jen36p8","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治流火（丝虫病引起的淋巴管炎）：朱砂根干根一至二两。水煎，调酒服。（《福建中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-21ly6gz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-21ly6gz","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治肺病及劳伤吐血：朱砂根三至五钱，同猪肺炖服。先吃汤，后去药吃肺，连吃三肺为一疗程。（《浙江民间常用草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-ul12i9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-ul12i9y","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治跌打损伤，关节风痛：朱砂根三至五钱。水煎或冲黄酒服。（《浙江民间常用草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-exim6v4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-exim6v4","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治妇女白带，痛经：朱砂根三至五钱。水煎或加白糖、黄酒冲服。（《浙江民间常用草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-rtoiea5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-rtoiea5","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治毒蛇咬伤：朱砂根鲜者二两。水煎服；另用盐肤木叶或树皮、乌桕叶适量，煎汤清洗伤口，用朱砂根皮捣烂，敷创口周围。（《单方验方调查资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-pt9b0i5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-pt9b0i5","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】治疗急性咽峡炎：用10％水煎液，每服30毫升，每天3次；或用粉剂1克装胶囊吞服，每天3次；或用蜜丸，日服3次，每次1丸（含药粉1克）。经治45例，痊愈22例，好转19例，无效4例。一般于服药当天咽痛减轻，第2天热退，3～4天局部红肿消退。服药后少数有恶心、呕吐、胃区痛等副作用，停药后即可恢复。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-wf182ek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-wf182ek","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】湖南地区尚以同属植物两色紫金牛与本品同等使用。当地称为\"红浪伞\"、\"紫背朱砂根\"。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-pi8hhk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-pi8hhk5","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-cysv8zs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-cysv8zs","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"朱砂根《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-exi1rgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-exi1rgj","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《本草纲目》:朱砂根，生深山中，今惟太和山人采之。苗高尺许，叶似冬青叶，背甚赤，夏月长茂，根大如箸，赤色，此与百两金仿佛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-07figsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-07figsd","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ZhūShāGēn"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-3icsuwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-3icsuwa","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】紫金牛、凤凰肠、老鼠尾、平地木、石青子、凉伞遮金珠、铁伞、散血丹、浪伞根、金鸡爪、高脚罗伞、小罗伞、士丹皮、金锁匙、开喉箭、三条根、三两金、高茶风、铁凉伞、雪里开花、金鸡凉伞、大罗伞、凤凰翔、大凉伞、红铜盘、高脚铜盘、青红草、硬脚金鸡、珍珠伞、桂笃油、真珠凉伞、八爪龙、郎伞树、龙山子、八爪金龙、豹子眼睛果、万龙、万两金"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-28q76v4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-28q76v4","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-o3y7sla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-o3y7sla","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为紫金牛科植物朱砂根或红凉伞的根。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-cehwqb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-cehwqb9","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1．ArdisiacrenataSims2．ArdisiacrenataSimsvar.bicolpr（Walker）C．Y．WuetC．Chen［A．BicolorWalker］"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-usvv7d0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-usvv7d0","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季采挖，切碎，晒干或鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-sswkrok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-sswkrok","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-nofdf3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-nofdf3r","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.灌木，高1-2m。除侧生特殊花枝外，无分枝。叶互生；叶柄长约1cm；叶片革质或坚纸质，椭圆形、椭圆状披针形至倒披针形，先端急尖或渐尖，基部换形，长7一15cm，‘宽2-4cm，边缘具皱波状或波状齿，具明显的边缘腺点，有时背面具极小的鳞片；侧脉12-18对，构成不规则的边缘脉。伞形花序或聚伞花序，着生于侧生特殊花枝顶端；花枝近顶端常具2-3片叶；花梗长7-10mm；萼片长圆状卵形，长1.5mm或略短，稀达2.5mm，具腺点；花瓣白色，稀略带粉红色，盛开时反卷，印形，先端急尖，具腺点，里面有时近基部具乳头状突起；雄蕊较花瓣短，花药三角状披针形，背面常具腺点；雌蕊与花瓣近等长或略长，子房具腺点。果球形，直径6-8mm，鲜红色，具腺点。花期5-6月，果期10-12月，有时2-4月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-r39efzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-r39efzu","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.本变种与朱砂根的区别为：叶背、花梗、花萼及花瓣均带紫红色，有的植株叶两面均为紫红色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-xcbvmy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-xcbvmy7","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-i03yn7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-i03yn7g","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：1.生于海拔500-2000m的林荫下或灌丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-e3tfwbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-e3tfwbc","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生于海拔500-2000m的林荫下或灌丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-nfkuthl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-nfkuthl","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于西藏东南部至台湾，湖北至海南各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-pki4dv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-pki4dv1","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于西藏东南部至台湾，湖北至海南各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-boefs2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-boefs2f","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-7cgawyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-7cgawyn","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性产亚热带，喜温暖、荫蔽和湿润的环境。忌干旱，要求通风及排水良好的肥沃土壤。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-lotduwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-lotduwg","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用种子或压条繁殖。北方春季播种，南方12月播种，发芽适温18℃，春季压条，秋季即可分割。长江流域可露地栽培，宜选湿润荫蔽林下，或流水溅雾又不直晒之处栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-xodicsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-xodicsj","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理北方宜盆栽室内越冬。夏、秋季要求水分充足，通风良好，保持半阴。4-10月每月施液肥1～2次，新梢长至8cm以上时去顶摘心，促进分枝。如枝条细弱，可产3月留地面8～10cm剪去，随即追肥，7～10d1次，植株重新萌发后可变粗壮。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-ifsfqjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-ifsfqjc","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-2ykbgsp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-2ykbgsp","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别根簇生于略膨大的根茎上，呈圆柱形，略弯曲，长5-25cm，直径2-10mm。表面棕褐色或灰棕色，具多数纵皱纹及横向或环状断裂痕，皮部与木部易分离。质硬而脆，易折断，折断面不平坦，皮部厚，约占断面的一半，类白色或浅紫红色，木部淡黄色。气微，味微苦、辛，有刺舌感。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-rwpk2oh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-rwpk2oh","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以条粗、皮厚者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-rv5twgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-rv5twgd","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别根横切面：木栓层为10余列木栓细胞，内侧1-数列细胞的内壁增厚，木化，似石细胞样。皮层宽广；内皮层明显，细胞含棕色物质，中柱鞘有单个或数个石细胞断续排列成环。韧皮部狭窄。束内形成层可见，木质部发达，导管多单列径向排列，有的含棕黄色物；木射线宽2-6列细胞。薄壁细胞含淀粉粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-22qwlst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-22qwlst","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特征：淡棕红色。①淀粉粒众多，类圆形、不规则卵圆形、盔帽形，直径8-28-39μm，脐点点状、裂缝状，有的可见层纹；复粒由2-4分粒组成。②石细胞类方形、不规则长方形、类三角形，直径约20μm，壁厚薄不一，纹孔明显；散在皮层的石细胞，直径4-7μm，壁厚，腔小。③木栓细胞类多角形，壁略厚。此外有具缘纹孔导管、木纤维及薄壁细胞。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-tfrjm2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-tfrjm2y","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】朱砂根的根含三萜皂甙：朱砂根甙（ardic-renin）[1]，朱砂根新甙（ardisicrenoside）A、B，百两金皂甙（ardisi－acrispin）A、B[2]，以及次生单糖甙3－O-α-L-仙客来甙元A-吡喃阿拉伯糖甙（3-O-α-L-cyclamiretinA－arabinopyranoside）[3]，还含岩白菜素（bergenin）及其衍生物：11－O-没食子酰基岩白菜素（11-O-galloylbergenin），11－O-丁香酰基岩白菜素（11－O－syringylbergenin），11－O-香草酰基岩白菜素（11－O-vanilloylbergenin），11－O-（3′，4′－二甲基没食子酰基岩白菜素）[11-O-（3′，4′-dimethyl-galloyl）bergenin］[4]，去甲岩白菜素（demethylbergenin），以及无羁萜（friedelin），β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol），紫金牛醌（rapanone）[5]，胡萝卜甙（daucosterol），菠菜甾醇（spinasterol），含18～30个碳原子的系列脂肪酸、蔗糖（sucrose）[6]和一新颖的环状缩酚酸肽FR900359[7，8]。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-1j4xrde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-1j4xrde","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-quzq621","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-quzq621","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.抑菌作用25%煎剂试管内对金黄色葡萄球菌、大肠杆菌、绿脓杆菌有轻度的抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-5cjowlb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-5cjowlb","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抗早孕作用60%的乙醇提取物有抗早孕作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-x0we0pn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-x0we0pn","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-gwbdvvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-gwbdvvd","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.净制：除去杂质，洗净。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-tqvjq8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-tqvjq8b","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.切制：洗净，切碎，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-cku75mi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-cku75mi","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦、辛、性凉"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-050akm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-050akm7","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热解毒；活血止痛。主咽喉肿痛；风湿热痹；黄疸；痢疾；跌打损伤；流火；乳腺炎；睾丸炎"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-gqvom5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-gqvom5b","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，15-30g。外用：适量，捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-ps6ffmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-ps6ffmb","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】虚弱者慎用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-vqzfb0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-vqzfb0c","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-bk7sriy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-bk7sriy","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《纲目》:治咽喉肿痹，蘑水或醋咽之。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-dethyo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-dethyo0","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《生草药性备要》:治痰火，跌打，去瘀生新，宽筋续骨。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-8546tpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-8546tpq","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《岭南采药录》:治小儿干(疳)痞。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-ttxjdtm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-ttxjdtm","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《广西中药志》:治风湿骨痛，鹤膝风。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-p2029go","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-p2029go","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《湖南药物志》：治劳伤吐血，血崩，心胃气痛，腹胀腹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-70l6b25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-70l6b25","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《浙江民间常用草药》:清热解毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830172546-z3mn2n3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172546-z3mn2n3","updated":"20240830172637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830172547-ik0l952","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830172547-ik0l952","updated":"20240830172637"}},{"ID":"20240830172548-ricoeiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830172548-ricoeiu","updated":"20240830172637"}}]}